      "title": "the docrot",
      "description": "What's good my people, its your boy thedocrot and here's a little bit about what I'm doing here!\n\nI'm trying to be consistent in uploading two shorts a day, every day, and two videos a week, one on Wednesday and one on Friday unless I say otherwise! I've kept this going for a while but I'll try and let you all know if I can't do it. \n\nStreams will start between 6PM-7PM UK TIME (EVERY DAY!!!) unless I say otherwise!\n\nThere will be exceptions to this as I have different things happening at different times every week but I will update you for those changes! \n\n\nApart from that I'm here to bring good vibes and positive energy to your day so I hope you all enjoy!\n\nLove and Peace my people! ❤️😁\n\n\nLink to my Instagram (the docrot):\nhttps://www.instagram.com/thedocrot?igsh=MW1rMTYwOHR0bnVuYw==\n\nLink to my Tiktok (thedocrot):\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@thedocrot?_t=ZN-8zjEyZ7EROw&_r=1\n\n\nI hope you all enjoy my videos and Don't forget to check out my clan LyNx!\nHave fun people!",
      "customUrl": "@thedocrot",
      "publishedAt": "2016-08-05T13:50:20Z",
